@using booking_room.Components.Models
@using booking_room.Services
@inject IToastService ToastService
@inject IModalService ModalService
@implements IDisposable

<AppModal Visible="true" Size="md" ShowCloseButton="false" OnClose="HandleBack">
    <HeaderContent>
        <div class="cbm-header-content">
            <h2 class="modal-title">Konfirmasi Pemesanan Ruangan</h2>
            <p class="modal-subtitle">Lengkapi formulir reservasi untuk menjadwalkan ruangan rapat.</p>
        </div>
    </HeaderContent>

    <ChildContent>
        <div class="cbm-form">
            <!-- Form Nama Pemesan & Divisi -->
            <div class="cbm-form-row">
                <div class="cbm-form-group">
                    <label class="cbm-label">Nama Pemesan</label>
                    <div class="input-icon-wrap">
                        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
                            <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
                        </svg>
                        <input type="text" class="cbm-input has-icon" @bind="_requesterName" placeholder="Nama Lengkap Pemesan" />
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="cbm-form-group">
                    <label class="cbm-label">Divisi / Departemen</label>
                    <div class="input-icon-wrap">
                        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                            <path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path>
                        </svg>
                        <input type="text" class="cbm-input has-icon" @bind="_department" placeholder="cth. IT / Marketing / HR" />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- CASE 2: Pilihan Ruangan Horizontal Scroll dengan Scroll-Snap & Fade Indicator -->
            <div class="cbm-form-group">
                <div class="cbm-section-header-row">
                    <label class="cbm-label">Pilih Ruangan</label>
                    <span class="cbm-sub-indicator">Geser untuk melihat ruangan lainnya &rarr;</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="room-carousel-outer">
                    <div class="room-horizontal-carousel">
                        @foreach (var r in _availableRoomOptions)
                        {
                            var isSelected = (SelectedRoom?.Name == r.Name) || (SelectedRoom == null && Room?.Name == r.Name);
                            <div class="room-carousel-card @(isSelected ? "selected" : "")" @onclick="() => SelectRoom(r)">
                                <div class="carousel-card-top">
                                    <div class="carousel-room-icon">
                                        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                            <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path>
                                            <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline>
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="carousel-status-badge @(r.Status == "available" ? "available" : "booked")">
                                        @(r.Status == "available" ? "Tersedia" : "Dipesan")
                                    </span>
                                </div>
                                <h4 class="carousel-room-name">@r.Name</h4>
                                <div class="carousel-room-meta">
                                    <span>Kapasitas: @r.Capacity Orang</span>
                                    <span>•</span>
                                    <span>@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(r.Floor) ? "Lantai 3" : r.Floor)</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="carousel-room-facilities">
                                    <span class="f-chip">TV LED</span>
                                    <span class="f-chip">WiFi</span>
                                    <span class="f-chip">AC</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        }
                    </div>
                    <div class="carousel-fade-edge"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tanggal & Waktu -->
            <div class="cbm-form-row">
                <div class="cbm-form-group">
                    <label class="cbm-label">Tanggal Pelaksanaan</label>
                    <input type="date" class="cbm-input" @bind="_bookingDate" @bind:after="UpdateSchedulePreview" />
                </div>
                <div class="cbm-form-group">
                    <label class="cbm-label">Waktu Rapat</label>
                    <div class="cbm-time-row">
                        <input type="time" class="cbm-input" @bind="_startTime" />
                        <span class="time-sep">-</span>
                        <input type="time" class="cbm-input" @bind="_endTime" />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- CASE 3: Bagian Undang Peserta dengan Indikator Kapasitas Bar & Tag Konflik -->
            <div class="attendees-section-card">
                <div class="attendees-header-row">
                    <div>
                        <div class="section-card-title">Undang Peserta</div>
                        <div class="section-card-sub">Tambahkan rekan kerja internal untuk rapat ini</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="capacity-meter-box">
                        <div class="capacity-text">
                            <strong>@TotalAttendeesCount</strong> dari <strong>@CurrentMaxCapacity</strong> Kapasitas Ruangan
                        </div>
                        <div class="capacity-progress-track">
                            <div class="capacity-progress-fill @(IsOverCapacity ? "over-capacity" : "")" 
                                 style="width: @CapacityPercentage%;"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Input Pencarian Kolega -->
                <div class="attendee-search-row">
                    <div class="input-icon-wrap" style="flex: 1;">
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                            <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
                            <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
                        </svg>
                        <input type="text" class="cbm-input has-icon" placeholder="Cari kolega..." 
                               @bind="_newAttendeeInput" @bind:event="oninput" @onkeydown="HandleAttendeeKeyDown" />
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-add-attendee" @onclick="AddAttendee">
                        + Tambah
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Quick Suggestions -->
                <div class="quick-colleagues-row">
                    <span class="quick-label">Saran Cepat:</span>
                    @foreach (var suggestion in _suggestedColleagues.Where(s => !_colleagues.Any(c => c.Name == s.Name)).Take(4))
                    {
                        <button type="button" class="quick-colleague-chip" @onclick="() => AddQuickAttendee(suggestion)">
                            + @suggestion.Name
                        </button>
                    }
                </div>

                <!-- Daftar Chip Peserta Terpilih -->
                <div class="attendees-chips-list">
                    @foreach (var c in _colleagues)
                    {
                        <div class="attendee-chip @(c.HasConflict ? "has-conflict" : "")">
                            <div class="chip-avatar" style="background: @c.AvatarBg;">
                                @GetInitials(c.Name)
                            </div>
                            <span class="chip-name">@c.Name</span>
                            @if (c.HasConflict)
                            {
                                <span class="chip-conflict-tag" title="Kolega memiliki agenda lain pada rentang waktu yang sama">
                                    Potensi konflik jadwal
                                </span>
                            }
                            <button type="button" class="chip-remove-btn" @onclick="() => RemoveAttendee(c)" title="Hapus">
                                &times;
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    }
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- CASE 3: Bagian Undang Tamu Eksternal -->
            <div class="external-guests-card">
                <div class="external-toggle-row">
                    <div>
                        <div class="section-card-title">Undang Tamu Eksternal</div>
                        <div class="section-card-sub">Kirimkan tautan dan undangan otomatis ke email luar</div>
                    </div>
                    <label class="cbm-switch">
                        <input type="checkbox" @bind="_inviteExternal" />
                        <span class="cbm-slider"></span>
                    </label>
                </div>

                @if (_inviteExternal)
                {
                    <div class="external-input-panel content-fade-in">
                        <div class="external-input-row">
                            <div class="input-icon-wrap" style="flex: 1;">
                                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
                                    <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
                                </svg>
                                <input type="email" class="cbm-input has-icon" placeholder="Email Tamu (contoh: tamu@perusahaan.com)" 
                                       @bind="_newExternalEmail" @onkeydown="HandleExternalKeyDown" />
                            </div>
                            <button type="button" class="btn-add-attendee" @onclick="AddExternalGuest">
                                Tambah Email
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        @if (_externalGuests.Any())
                        {
                            <div class="external-chips-list">
                                @foreach (var email in _externalGuests)
                                {
                                    <div class="external-email-chip">
                                        <span class="email-text">@email</span>
                                        <button type="button" class="chip-remove-btn" @onclick="() => RemoveExternalGuest(email)">&times;</button>
                                    </div>
                                }
                            </div>
                        }
                    </div>
                }
            </div>

            <!-- Toggle Jadikan Berulang (Recurring Booking) -->
            <div class="recurring-toggle-card">
                <div class="recurring-toggle-info">
                    <div class="toggle-title">Jadikan Berulang (Recurring Booking)</div>
                    <div class="toggle-desc">Jadwalkan pemesanan ini secara berulang otomatis pada hari tertentu</div>
                </div>
                <label class="cbm-switch">
                    <input type="checkbox" @bind="IsRecurring" />
                    <span class="cbm-slider"></span>
                </label>
            </div>

            @if (IsRecurring)
            {
                <div class="cbm-sub-panel recurring-panel content-fade-in">
                    <!-- Segmented Control Pola Perulangan -->
                    <div class="cbm-form-group">
                        <label class="cbm-label">Pola Perulangan</label>
                        <div class="cbm-segmented-tabs">
                            <button type="button" class="segmented-tab @(RecurringType == "Harian" ? "active" : "")" @onclick='() => SetRecurringType("Harian")'>Harian</button>
                            <button type="button" class="segmented-tab @(RecurringType == "Mingguan" ? "active" : "")" @onclick='() => SetRecurringType("Mingguan")'>Mingguan</button>
                            <button type="button" class="segmented-tab @(RecurringType == "Bulanan" ? "active" : "")" @onclick='() => SetRecurringType("Bulanan")'>Bulanan</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Pemilih Hari (Inisial Hari Indonesia) -->
                    @if (RecurringType == "Mingguan")
                    {
                        <div class="cbm-form-group">
                            <label class="cbm-label">Pilih Hari (S, S, R, K, J, S, M)</label>
                            <div class="cbm-days-grid">
                                @foreach (var day in _indonesianDays)
                                {
                                    <button type="button" class="cbm-day-bubble @(SelectedDays.Contains(day.Initial) ? "active" : "")" 
                                            @onclick="() => ToggleDay(day.Initial)" title="@day.FullName">
                                        <span class="bubble-initial">@day.Initial</span>
                                        <span class="bubble-sub">@day.ShortName</span>
                                    </button>
                                }
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    }

                    <!-- Opsi Batas Berakhir -->
                    <div class="cbm-form-row">
                        <div class="cbm-form-group">
                            <label class="cbm-label">Berakhir Setelah</label>
                            <div class="input-suffix-wrap">
                                <input type="number" min="1" max="52" class="cbm-input" @bind="_recurrenceCount" @bind:after="UpdateSchedulePreview" />
                                <span class="input-suffix">Kali</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="cbm-form-group">
                            <label class="cbm-label">Atau Tanggal Akhir</label>
                            <input type="date" class="cbm-input" @bind="RecurringEndDate" @bind:after="UpdateSchedulePreview" />
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Preview Jadwal Hasil Perulangan -->
                    <div class="schedule-preview-box">
                        <div class="schedule-preview-header">
                            <span class="preview-title">Preview Jadwal (@_previewDates.Count Tanggal)</span>
                            <span class="preview-note">Otomatis dicek ketersediaannya</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="preview-dates-list">
                            @foreach (var item in _previewDates)
                            {
                                <div class="preview-date-item @(item.IsConflict ? "conflict" : "available")">
                                    <div class="date-item-info">
                                        <div class="date-item-title">@item.DateFormatted</div>
                                        <div class="date-item-time">@_startTime.ToString("HH:mm") - @_endTime.ToString("HH:mm") WIB</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="date-item-status">
                                        @if (item.IsConflict)
                                        {
                                            <span class="badge-conflict">Konflik Jadwal</span>
                                            <button type="button" class="btn-skip-slot" @onclick="() => SkipDate(item)">Lewati</button>
                                        }
                                        else
                                        {
                                            <span class="badge-slot-ok">Tersedia</span>
                                        }
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            }
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            }

            <div class="cbm-form-group">
                <label class="cbm-label">Tujuan Rapat / Catatan Khusus</label>
                <textarea class="cbm-input" rows="2" placeholder="cth. Rapat koordinasi proyek kuartal berjalan..." @bind="_notes"></textarea>
            </div>
        </div>
    </ChildContent>

    <FooterContent>
        <button class="btn-secondary-app" @onclick="HandleBack" disabled="@_isSubmitting">
            Batal
        </button>
        <button class="btn-primary-app" @onclick="HandleConfirm" disabled="@_isSubmitting">
            @if (_isSubmitting)
            {
                <svg class="spinner" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <line x1="12" y1="2" x2="12" y2="6"></line>
                    <line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12" y2="22"></line>
                    <line x1="4.93" y1="4.93" x2="7.76" y2="7.76"></line>
                    <line x1="16.24" y1="16.24" x2="19.07" y2="19.07"></line>
                    <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="6" y2="12"></line>
                    <line x1="18" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line>
                    <line x1="4.93" y1="19.07" x2="7.76" y2="16.24"></line>
                    <line x1="16.24" y1="7.76" x2="19.07" y2="4.93"></line>
                </svg>
                <span>Memproses Reservasi...</span>
            }
            else
            {
                <span>Konfirmasi Pemesanan</span>
            }
        </button>
    </FooterContent>
</AppModal>

<style>
    .cbm-header-content {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 4px;
    }
    .modal-title {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--persada-navy-900, #0F1F3D);
        margin: 0;
    }
    .modal-subtitle {
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        color: var(--persada-text-secondary, #6B7280);
        margin: 0;
    }
    
    .cbm-form {
        padding: 20px 24px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
    }

    .cbm-form-row {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 14px;
    }

    .cbm-form-group {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 6px;
    }

    .cbm-section-header-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .cbm-sub-indicator {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: #1F5D9A;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .cbm-label {
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--persada-text-primary, #374151);
    }

    .input-icon-wrap {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .input-icon-wrap svg {
        position: absolute;
        left: 12px;
        color: #9CA3AF;
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .cbm-input {
        width: 100%;
        height: 40px;
        padding: 0 12px;
        border: 1.5px solid var(--color-brand-gray-border, #E5E7EB);
        border-radius: 10px;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        background: #FFFFFF;
        color: var(--persada-text-primary, #111827);
        outline: none;
        transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .cbm-input.has-icon {
        padding-left: 38px;
    }
    .cbm-input:focus {
        border-color: #1F5D9A;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(31, 93, 154, 0.12);
    }
    textarea.cbm-input {
        height: auto;
        padding: 10px 12px;
        resize: vertical;
    }

    /* CASE 2: Room Carousel with Scroll-Snap & Fade Edge */
    .room-carousel-outer {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .room-horizontal-carousel {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        overflow-x: auto;
        scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
        padding: 4px 12px 10px 2px;
        -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
        scrollbar-width: thin;
    }
    .room-horizontal-carousel::-webkit-scrollbar {
        height: 5px;
    }
    .room-horizontal-carousel::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
        background: #CBD5E1;
        border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .room-carousel-card {
        scroll-snap-align: start;
        flex: 0 0 240px;
        width: 240px;
        padding: 12px;
        background: #F8FAFC;
        border: 1.5px solid #E2E8F0;
        border-radius: 14px;
        cursor: pointer;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 6px;
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    body.dark-mode .room-carousel-card {
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
        border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .room-carousel-card:hover {
        border-color: #CBD5E1;
        transform: translateY(-1px);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(15, 31, 61, 0.05);
    }
    .room-carousel-card.selected {
        border-color: #1F5D9A;
        background: #EFF6FF;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(31, 93, 154, 0.12);
    }
    body.dark-mode .room-carousel-card.selected {
        background: rgba(31, 93, 154, 0.2);
        border-color: #3B82F6;
    }

    .carousel-card-top {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .carousel-room-icon {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: #FFFFFF;
        border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
        color: #1F5D9A;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
    }
    body.dark-mode .carousel-room-icon {
        background: #1E293B;
        border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        color: #93C5FD;
    }

    .carousel-status-badge {
        font-size: 0.6875rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        padding: 2px 8px;
        border-radius: 999px;
    }
    .carousel-status-badge.available {
        background: #E7F8EF;
        color: #16A34A;
    }
    .carousel-status-badge.booked {
        background: #FFF4E5;
        color: #D97706;
    }

    .carousel-room-name {
        margin: 2px 0 0 0;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--persada-text-primary, #0F1F3D);
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    .carousel-room-meta {
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: var(--persada-text-secondary, #6B7280);
        display: flex;
        gap: 6px;
    }

    .carousel-room-facilities {
        display: flex;
        gap: 4px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .f-chip {
        font-size: 0.625rem;
        background: #FFFFFF;
        border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
        color: #475569;
        padding: 1px 5px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    body.dark-mode .f-chip {
        background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8);
        border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        color: #CBD5E1;
    }

    .carousel-fade-edge {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        right: 0;
        bottom: 8px;
        width: 32px;
        background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9));
        pointer-events: none;
        border-radius: 0 14px 14px 0;
    }
    body.dark-mode .carousel-fade-edge {
        background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(16, 27, 46, 0.9));
    }

    /* CASE 3: Attendees Section & Capacity Meter */
    .attendees-section-card,
    .external-guests-card {
        padding: 14px 16px;
        background: #F8FAFC;
        border: 1.5px solid var(--color-brand-gray-border, #E5E7EB);
        border-radius: 14px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
    }
    body.dark-mode .attendees-section-card,
    body.dark-mode .external-guests-card {
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
        border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .attendees-header-row,
    .external-toggle-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .section-card-title {
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--persada-text-primary, #0F1F3D);
    }
    .section-card-sub {
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: var(--persada-text-secondary, #6B7280);
    }

    .capacity-meter-box {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-end;
        gap: 4px;
    }

    .capacity-text {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--persada-text-primary, #374151);
    }

    .capacity-progress-track {
        width: 140px;
        height: 6px;
        background: #E2E8F0;
        border-radius: 999px;
        overflow: hidden;
    }
    body.dark-mode .capacity-progress-track {
        background: #334155;
    }

    .capacity-progress-fill {
        height: 100%;
        background: #F59E0B;
        border-radius: 999px;
        transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }
    .capacity-progress-fill.over-capacity {
        background: #EF4444;
    }

    .attendee-search-row,
    .external-input-row {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
    }

    .btn-add-attendee {
        height: 40px;
        padding: 0 14px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: #1F5D9A;
        color: #FFFFFF;
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        white-space: nowrap;
        transition: background 0.15s ease;
    }
    .btn-add-attendee:hover {
        background: #164879;
    }

    .quick-colleagues-row {
